action: adopt
outcome: Option (a): obtain the second distinct CI run ID on the final SHA by closing and reopening PR #6, only after the candidate is frozen; no commit is made only to trigger CI
effect: LXM-REQ-000153
authorizes: SRC-0025 §0.2, LXM-REQ-000153
adopted: 2026-10-31, by the owner, Bipin Kumar (identity as stated: bipin.kumar@aol.com, bipin1@gmail.com; not verified by the gate)
